-- src:174-203 | of evidence‑in‑chief of the witnesses have been filed and exchanged, the Court will give the necessary directions in respect of the following matters:
-- src:174-203 | ( a ) addition or removal of parties; ( b ) consolidation of actions; ( c ) division of issues at trial to be heard separately; ( d ) security for
-- src:174-203 | costs; ( e ) further and better particulars of pleadings; ( f ) amendment of pleadings; ( g ) filing of further pleadings; ( h ) striking out of part
-- src:174-203 | of an action or of the defence; ( i ) judgment on admission of facts; ( j ) determination of questions of law or construction of documents; ( k )
-- src:174-203 | production of documents; ( l ) interim relief; ( m ) expert evidence and assessors; ( n ) independent witness and interested non‑parties; ( o )
-- src:174-203 | independent counsel.
@ref O 2 r 9(1) (src:174-203)
GIVEN `the Court does not make any order described in Rule 8` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Court has made an order as described in Rule 8` IS A BOOLEAN
      `affidavits of evidence-in-chief of the witnesses have been filed and exchanged` IS A BOOLEAN
      matter IS A `o 2 r 9(1) the matter`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 2 r 9(1) the Court will give the necessary directions in respect of that matter` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the Court does not make any order described in Rule 8` OR (`the Court has made an order as described in Rule 8` AND `affidavits of evidence-in-chief of the witnesses have been filed and exchanged`))
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the Court does not make any order described in Rule 8, or where the Court has made an order as described in that Rule, after affidavits of evidence‑in‑chief of the witnesses have been filed and exchanged"
    ELSE
        CONSIDER matter
        WHEN `o 2 r 9(1) some other matter` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "the following matters" has no "only"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

