        IF `the Court approves`
            THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): "without the Court’s approval" lifts the negative and does not grant a permission
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "cannot be filed without the Court’s approval"

