        IF `it is sought by letter` AND `the letter sets out the essence of the intended application` AND `the letter explains why there is a special case`
            THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "has to be sought by letter setting out the essence of the intended application and explaining why there is a special case"

