    BRANCH
        IF NOT `fixed costs apply under these Rules`
            THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the rule is of "the cases to which fixed costs apply under these Rules"
        IF `the Court otherwise orders`
            THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "unless the Court otherwise orders"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

